# Derived from the harness's root .gitignore, trimmed to the rules that apply to
# this tree. Foundry's build output and the local deployment record already have
# their own .gitignore files (contracts/, deployments/) and are not repeated here.
node_modules/
.env
*.log
# The secrets file itself, wherever it is written. Keyed on the FILE rather than
# on a directory name: the directory is a variable and has already been two
# different values, the filename is the invariant.
chain.env
**/chain.env
# The typecheck:all failure diagnostic: a local artefact of a failing run, never
# committed.
.typecheck-failure.log

# codegraph index
.codegraph/
